  "title": "Kirby Problem 1.28",
  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Let $L$ be a link in the thickened annulus $S^{1} \\times I \\times I$.\n(a) Wrapping conjecture: $w(L)$ is equal to the maximal nonzero annular de-\ngree of the annular Kauffman bracket of $L$.\n(b) Categorifed wrapping conjecture: $w(L)$ is equal to the maximal nonzero\nannular grading of the annular Khovanov homology of $L$.",
